      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Many times reported, thanks to poor Network IK. I always use handwriting or pens due my bad hearing, but you made VRChat very unfriendly for deaf, mute and bad hearing people... \nThis is not good and must fixed ASAP.",
      "viewerReactions": null
