      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This may be caused by the general delay with network IK. The times a player activates their gesture/marker is not delayed like IK is, so on other clients they draw at the wrong times and the result is garbled. I seem to be able to draw by holding my marker in place for a few seconds, then drawing one continuous line and holding it in place at the end for a few more seconds.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
